Main changes in this modified version:
  - Jellyfin-first media layout and file naming.
  - Bangumi (bgm.tv) as the preferred anime metadata source,
    with TMDB as fallback.
  - qBittorrent webhook integration with hardlink-first transfer,
    duplicate suppression, and seeding-safe behavior.
  - AI result schema generalized from TMDB-only fields to
    provider-neutral season/episode fields.
  - README and documentation rewritten around Jellyfin and Bangumi.

